  "releaseNotes": "AddedAutomatic Stream Fallback (vidsrc.sbs): Replaced legacy fallback services with a robust, direct path-based routing structure (/embed/movie/{tmdb_id} and /embed/tv/{tmdb_id}/{season}/{episode}) to ensure smooth playback when local scrapers don't have the file.
Interactive Scraper Selection Modal & "Auto" Button: Replaced automated racing with an interactive bottom sheet displaying search results from VegaMovies and RogMovies simultaneously, along with an "Auto" fallback button for instant streaming.
WebView Embedded Player & Ad Blocker: Integrated webview_flutter with Android media playback settings (setMediaPlaybackRequiresUserGesture(false)) and navigation interception to block redirect ads and spam popups.
Developer Easter Egg: Added a fun 10-second device shake sensor listener that triggers a glassmorphic greeting modal celebrating Om Gondhankhede (aka vinayak_builder).
Auto-Updating Version JSON Workflow: Set up a GitHub Actions workflow to automatically update your version.json file whenever pubspec.yaml is updated on the main branch.."
